---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - VKU Zug"
  description="Privacy Policy of VKU Zug"
  canonical="https://vku-kurs-zug.ch/en/datenschutz"
  lang="en"
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-blue-800 text-white py-12">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Privacy</h1>
      <p class="text-xl">Privacy policy</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="bg-gray-50 py-4">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <a href="/en/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Home</a> > <span
        class="text-gray-600">Privacy</span
      >
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section class="py-12 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="prose"><h2>Controller</h2><p>DriveLab GmbH, Lauriedhofweg 12, 6300 Zug, Switzerland.</p><h2>Information and enquiries</h2><p>The planner displays public course dates. Cloudflare processes technical connection data when serving a page. You enter your name, email, optional phone number and message in DriveLab’s contact form.</p><h2>Purpose</h2><p>Technical data supports site delivery and security. DriveLab handles enquiries, bookings and payments on its main site.</p><h2>Retention</h2><p>Retention depends on the purpose of processing and statutory requirements. See the main privacy policy for information about booking records.</p><h2>Security</h2><p>Information is transmitted over HTTPS. The planner reads public event information to display courses.</p><h2>Your rights</h2><p>You can request access, correction or deletion. Depending on the applicable law, you may also request restriction, object to processing or request portability.</p><h2>Cookies and measurement</h2><p>The planner uses no analytics cookies to compare groups. Booking links identify this site and the campaign. On drivelab.ch you can manage statistics and advertising in the cookie settings.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>When you visit another website, its privacy policy applies.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Send privacy questions to info@drivelab.ch.</p><p><a href="https://drivelab.ch/datenschutzerklaerung/">DriveLab privacy policy</a></p></div>
    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a
        href="/en/"
        class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded font-bold hover:bg-blue-700 inline-block"
        >Back to home</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb Schema -->
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 1,
          "name": "Home",
          "item": "https://vku-kurs-zug.ch/"
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 2,
          "name": "Datenschutz",
          "item": "https://vku-kurs-zug.ch/datenschutz"
        }
      ]
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
